From 0d03f8f959ba7d84fc8e9bdc5e932e28c24da30b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:10:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] MIG-1 F-C: prove the five loop specs and make the loop
 rows corollaries

Fill Turing.FinTM.loopHostTM_contracts, loopHostTM_decides, loopHostTM_finds,
loopHostTM_spaceUsed_le_budget and emitLoopTM_computes at coefficient 10.
The private loopHost_contracts now states the explicit coefficient and two
head clauses (seams within T |x|, terminal within T |x| + 10(T |x| + 1)),
using the strengthened loopHost_prepare fuel-head clause and the new private
loopCall_heads; the round-independent space budget follows from the private
segment_heads / seamed_space (moved from Catalog's f2_segment_heads /
f2_seamed_space) and the published spaceUsed_le_of_abs_le, which replaces
Catalog's f2_space_radius. exists_loopCfgTM, exists_loopTM,
exists_loopFindTM and exists_emitLoopTM are corollaries of the specs.
MIG-24 T1 (Loop part): loop_rewind_bounded is retired in favour of the
public timed_rewind; loop_first_halt is derived from exists_first_halt.
